  "intentional_repairs": [
    "Replaced copied obsolete two-phase property kernels with configured Fluid evaluations and independent saturation-coordinate Jacobian references.",
    "Corrected cv finite-difference variable/units, entropy constraint of sound speed, and both signed enthalpy partial derivatives.",
    "Energy finite differences use R_specific*T and p/rho rather than raw two-phase source cv or arbitrary absolute energy zero.",
    "Normalized ideal-gas root residual by cp*T0 and pressure coordinate by p0; retained Newton 1e-10 nominal tolerances and the original 21-point full sweep. Dimensional energy acceptance is 32*float64_eps*cp*T0 + 4*ULP(h0), explicitly replacing an unattainable fixed 1e-10 J/kg threshold.",
    "Corrected optimizer minimizer/objective labels and synchronized ordered instrumentation; original root/minimizer tolerances and step budgets retained."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Quick sampling does not replace the full Water 11-temperature and perfect-gas 21-Mach scientific sweeps.",
    "Rosenbrock nonlinear CG uses a step-based stopping condition; report its actual objective/position error rather than claim six decimal places in the minimizer.",
    "Callback instrumentation and one-shot elapsed observations are not statistical performance benchmarks."
  ],
